    "title": "Gazan women rescued from under rubble",
    "text": "Palestinians rescued on Wednesday (August 20) 23-year-old woman, Saja Hamad, from under the rubble, following an Israeli strike in Nuseirat in the central Gaza Strip.\nVideo obtained by Reuters showed Hamad trapped and aching, while rescuers tried to clear the rubble with their hands and shovels.\nReuters was not able to confirm the location where the video was recorded. The date when the video was recorded was verified by the metadata on the original video file.",
